## 4. The Level — Lightless Caverns

One long, escalating level. With flip-at-will, the journey can wind **horizontally
and vertically** through the tunnel system. _(draft curve)_
- **Act 1 — Teach:** flipping, the lethal gap, then first two-body verbs (hold-two-at-once, be-the-landing) in safe space.
- **Act 2 — Test:** shadow creatures; players separated across the gap; path-clearing & crossing-building puzzles.
- **Act 3 — Twist:** dense simultaneity, fast flips, environmental hazards combine; mystery deepens.
- **Climax / ending:** _(TBD — mystery payoff?)_

- [ ] Checkpoint cadence · approx length (see Gaps)

