## 7. Art & Audio Direction

Direction set by tone (**eerie**) + setting (**lightless caverns**).
- **Visual:** silhouette-forward; mirrored tunnel as composition (two figures on
  opposite walls, lethal void between). Deep blacks, cold palette, bioluminescent
  accent. Minimal UI. Gravity-flip needs a clear, readable tell.
- **Audio:** sparse cave ambience, drips, distant movement; sound telegraphs
  threats; a satisfying *whump* on each flip.
- [ ] Lock palette & reference board · animation feel

